Segment #1   [00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,280] | Elapsed:  15.46s | Words: 5  | Text: 你如果说兜里
Segment #2   [00:00:01,280 --> 00:00:02,900] | Elapsed:  15.46s | Words: 9  | Text: 从原本一块钱拿不出来
Segment #3   [00:00:02,900 --> 00:00:04,240] | Elapsed:  15.46s | Words: 9  | Text: 变成兜里有十万块钱
Segment #4   [00:00:04,240 --> 00:00:05,040] | Elapsed:  15.46s | Words: 7  | Text: 有二十万块钱了
Segment #5   [00:00:05,040 --> 00:00:06,800] | Elapsed:  15.46s | Words: 12 | Text: 你以为这是所谓的脱离了底层
Segment #6   [00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:07,480] | Elapsed:  15.46s | Words: 3  | Text: 但不是的
Segment #7   [00:00:07,480 --> 00:00:09,580] | Elapsed:  15.46s | Words: 13 | Text: 你的大脑还停留在底层人的大脑
Segment #8   [00:00:09,580 --> 00:00:11,860] | Elapsed:  15.46s | Words: 10 | Text: 你看它事物的方式和理解
Segment #9   [00:00:11,860 --> 00:00:13,960] | Elapsed:  15.46s | Words: 8  | Text: 理解问题的理解能力
Segment #10  [00:00:13,960 --> 00:00:16,900] | Elapsed:  15.46s | Words: 10 | Text: 都还停留在这个原始阶段
Segment #11  [00:00:16,900 --> 00:00:18,440] | Elapsed:  15.46s | Words: 7  | Text: 你不明白钱的价值
Segment #12  [00:00:18,440 --> 00:00:19,900] | Elapsed:  15.46s | Words: 8  | Text: 你也不明白朋友的作用
Segment #13  [00:00:19,900 --> 00:00:21,940] | Elapsed:  15.46s | Words: 10 | Text: 你更不明白你的时间的状况性
Segment #14  [00:00:21,940 --> 00:00:24,120] | Elapsed:  15.46s | Words: 10 | Text: 你只是在一个偶然的机会下
Segment #15  [00:00:24,120 --> 00:00:25,400] | Elapsed:  15.46s | Words: 7  | Text: 瞎摸碰到死号子
Segment #16  [00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:26,120] | Elapsed:  15.46s | Words: 4  | Text: 攒到钱了
Segment #17  [00:00:26,120 --> 00:00:27,900] | Elapsed:  15.46s | Words: 9  | Text: 并不代表你就不是底层了
Segment #18  [00:00:27,900 --> 00:00:29,900] | Elapsed:  33.34s | Words: 6  | Text: 就是你没有赚过钱
Segment #19  [00:00:29,900 --> 00:00:30,920] | Elapsed:  33.34s | Words: 4  | Text: 然后又反贫
Segment #20  [00:00:30,920 --> 00:00:31,980] | Elapsed:  33.34s | Words: 5  | Text: 然后又赚到钱
Segment #21  [00:00:31,980 --> 00:00:32,980] | Elapsed:  33.34s | Words: 6  | Text: 你永远是底层
Segment #22  [00:00:32,980 --> 00:00:34,360] | Elapsed:  33.34s | Words: 6  | Text: 人赚到钱以后
Segment #23  [00:00:34,360 --> 00:00:35,540] | Elapsed:  33.34s | Words: 7  | Text: 他会有什么反应的
Segment #24  [00:00:35,540 --> 00:00:36,820] | Elapsed:  33.34s | Words: 6  | Text: 赚到钱再反贫
Segment #25  [00:00:36,820 --> 00:00:37,560] | Elapsed:  33.34s | Words: 4  | Text: 再赚到钱
Segment #26  [00:00:37,560 --> 00:00:39,540] | Elapsed:  33.34s | Words: 10 | Text: 有很多人大概率就反不了贫了
Segment #27  [00:00:39,540 --> 00:00:40,660] | Elapsed:  33.34s | Words: 7  | Text: 因为他懂得几件事
Segment #28  [00:00:40,660 --> 00:00:41,240] | Elapsed:  33.34s | Words: 2  | Text: 首先第一
Segment #29  [00:00:41,240 --> 00:00:42,520] | Elapsed:  33.34s | Words: 6  | Text: 不再去证明自己
Segment #30  [00:00:42,520 --> 00:00:44,240] | Elapsed:  33.34s | Words: 5  | Text: 不会再有很多的
Segment #31  [00:00:44,240 --> 00:00:46,240] | Elapsed:  33.34s | Words: 9  | Text: 为情绪价值买单的事
Segment #32  [00:00:46,240 --> 00:00:47,840] | Elapsed:  33.34s | Words: 7  | Text: 会明白了钱的重要性
Segment #33  [00:00:47,840 --> 00:00:48,840] | Elapsed:  33.34s | Words: 5  | Text: 你的每一分钱
Segment #34  [00:00:48,840 --> 00:00:50,380] | Elapsed:  33.34s | Words: 5  | Text: 这都是你的士兵
Segment #35  [00:00:50,380 --> 00:00:51,260] | Elapsed:  33.34s | Words: 5  | Text: 这都是你的子弹
Segment #36  [00:00:51,260 --> 00:00:52,100] | Elapsed:  33.34s | Words: 5  | Text: 你要绝对掌控
Segment #37  [00:00:52,100 --> 00:00:54,380] | Elapsed:  33.34s | Words: 12 | Text: 就像我之前给你们分享的关键一样
Segment #38  [00:00:54,380 --> 00:00:56,040] | Elapsed:  33.34s | Words: 6  | Text: 就是一定要去赚第一次
Segment #39  [00:00:56,040 --> 00:00:57,260] | Elapsed:  33.34s | Words: 5  | Text: 有钱的人的钱
Segment #40  [00:00:57,260 --> 00:00:57,640] | Elapsed:  53.74s | Words: 1  | Text: 为什么
Segment #41  [00:00:57,640 --> 00:00:59,380] | Elapsed:  53.74s | Words: 7  | Text: 因为这个人第一次有钱
Segment #42  [00:00:59,380 --> 00:01:00,980] | Elapsed:  53.74s | Words: 7  | Text: 他急需要去证明自己
Segment #43  [00:01:00,980 --> 00:01:02,540] | Elapsed:  53.74s | Words: 9  | Text: 他会有很多额外的消费
Segment #44  [00:01:02,540 --> 00:01:03,280] | Elapsed:  53.74s | Words: 4  | Text: 为了情绪
Segment #45  [00:01:03,280 --> 00:01:04,100] | Elapsed:  53.74s | Words: 4  | Text: 为了面子
Segment #46  [00:01:04,100 --> 00:01:04,320] | Elapsed:  53.74s | Words: 1  | Text: 什么
Segment #47  [00:01:04,320 --> 00:01:04,960] | Elapsed:  53.74s | Words: 4  | Text: 你开本词
Segment #48  [00:01:04,960 --> 00:01:05,740] | Elapsed:  53.74s | Words: 5  | Text: 我还得买点
Segment #49  [00:01:05,740 --> 00:01:06,880] | Elapsed:  53.74s | Words: 8  | Text: 我得证明我比你强
Segment #50  [00:01:06,880 --> 00:01:07,640] | Elapsed:  53.74s | Words: 2  | Text: 因为我
Segment #51  [00:01:07,640 --> 00:01:08,340] | Elapsed:  53.74s | Words: 5  | Text: 我感觉我有钱
Segment #52  [00:01:08,340 --> 00:01:08,920] | Elapsed:  53.74s | Words: 1  | Text: 什么
Segment #53  [00:01:08,920 --> 00:01:10,220] | Elapsed:  53.74s | Words: 8  | Text: 你带了20万的手表
Segment #54  [00:01:10,220 --> 00:01:11,260] | Elapsed:  53.74s | Words: 6  | Text: 那我也得买一块
Segment #55  [00:01:11,260 --> 00:01:11,700] | Elapsed:  53.74s | Words: 1  | Text: 为什么
Segment #56  [00:01:11,700 --> 00:01:13,200] | Elapsed:  53.74s | Words: 6  | Text: 因为我要证明我自己
Segment #57  [00:01:13,200 --> 00:01:14,500] | Elapsed:  53.74s | Words: 5  | Text: 我要证明我有钱
Segment #58  [00:01:14,500 --> 00:01:15,500] | Elapsed:  53.74s | Words: 7  | Text: 你从夜总会送卡
Segment #59  [00:01:15,500 --> 00:01:16,060] | Elapsed:  53.74s | Words: 4  | Text: 送了5万
Segment #60  [00:01:16,060 --> 00:01:16,960] | Elapsed:  53.74s | Words: 6  | Text: 那我得冲20万
Segment #61  [00:01:16,960 --> 00:01:17,960] | Elapsed:  53.74s | Words: 5  | Text: 我要证明我自己
Segment #62  [00:01:17,960 --> 00:01:18,720] | Elapsed:  53.74s | Words: 4  | Text: 所以说要赚
Segment #63  [00:01:18,720 --> 00:01:20,060] | Elapsed:  53.74s | Words: 7  | Text: 第一次有钱人的钱
Segment #64  [00:01:20,060 --> 00:01:21,000] | Elapsed:  53.74s | Words: 5  | Text: 你现在刚才说
Segment #65  [00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:22,080] | Elapsed:  53.74s | Words: 7  | Text: 你从底层爬进来了
Segment #66  [00:01:22,080 --> 00:01:23,020] | Elapsed:  53.74s | Words: 6  | Text: 你说你赚到钱了
Segment #67  [00:01:23,020 --> 00:01:23,880] | Elapsed:  53.74s | Words: 5  | Text: 你没赚到钱
Segment #68  [00:01:23,880 --> 00:01:24,760] | Elapsed:  74.02s | Words: 5  | Text: 你会反凭的
Segment #69  [00:01:24,760 --> 00:01:26,000] | Elapsed:  74.02s | Words: 3  | Text: 90%的人
Segment #70  [00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:27,300] | Elapsed:  74.02s | Words: 8  | Text: 在第一次赚到钱之后
Segment #71  [00:01:27,300 --> 00:01:28,140] | Elapsed:  74.02s | Words: 5  | Text: 他一定会反凭
Segment #72  [00:01:28,140 --> 00:01:29,000] | Elapsed:  74.02s | Words: 3  | Text: 这是规律
Segment #73  [00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:30,160] | Elapsed:  74.02s | Words: 3  | Text: 这是规律
Segment #74  [00:01:30,160 --> 00:01:30,900] | Elapsed:  74.02s | Words: 4  | Text: 他就像什么
Segment #75  [00:01:30,900 --> 00:01:32,100] | Elapsed:  74.02s | Words: 7  | Text: 合酒逼分分酒逼
Segment #76  [00:01:32,100 --> 00:01:32,760] | Elapsed:  74.02s | Words: 4  | Text: 合一个道理
Segment #77  [00:01:32,760 --> 00:01:33,400] | Elapsed:  74.03s | Words: 3  | Text: 我告诉你
Segment #78  [00:01:33,400 --> 00:01:34,840] | Elapsed:  74.03s | Words: 9  | Text: 我曾经分为四个阶段
Segment #79  [00:01:34,840 --> 00:01:35,960] | Elapsed:  74.03s | Words: 5  | Text: 哪四个阶段
Segment #80  [00:01:35,960 --> 00:01:37,660] | Elapsed:  74.03s | Words: 7  | Text: 就是你在家里没有钱的时候
Segment #81  [00:01:37,660 --> 00:01:38,760] | Elapsed:  74.03s | Words: 6  | Text: 这是我的第一个阶段
Segment #82  [00:01:38,760 --> 00:01:39,980] | Elapsed:  74.03s | Words: 9  | Text: 但是我曾经我赚到块钱
Segment #83  [00:01:39,980 --> 00:01:40,800] | Elapsed:  74.03s | Words: 6  | Text: 就我反凭以后
Segment #84  [00:01:40,800 --> 00:01:43,040] | Elapsed:  74.03s | Words: 10 | Text: 然后我第二次又重新好起来
Segment #85  [00:01:43,040 --> 00:01:44,220] | Elapsed:  74.03s | Words: 8  | Text: 把我的债务扛完之后
Segment #86  [00:01:44,220 --> 00:01:45,420] | Elapsed:  74.03s | Words: 7  | Text: 我当时我的心态什么
Segment #87  [00:01:45,420 --> 00:01:46,100] | Elapsed:  74.03s | Words: 4  | Text: 也分享给你们
Segment #88  [00:01:46,100 --> 00:01:47,760] | Elapsed:  74.03s | Words: 8  | Text: 如果说你站在这个阶段
Segment #89  [00:01:47,760 --> 00:01:48,940] | Elapsed:  74.03s | Words: 5  | Text: 你首先你要告诉自己
Segment #90  [00:01:48,940 --> 00:01:49,980] | Elapsed:  74.03s | Words: 5  | Text: 你要接受现状
Segment #91  [00:01:49,980 --> 00:01:52,700] | Elapsed:  74.03s | Words: 8  | Text: 你要让自己清楚地认识到
Segment #92  [00:01:52,700 --> 00:01:53,220] | Elapsed:  74.03s | Words: 3  | Text: 你拉了
Segment #93  [00:01:53,220 --> 00:01:54,160] | Elapsed:  93.61s | Words: 3  | Text: 你是小弟
Segment #94  [00:01:54,160 --> 00:01:55,180] | Elapsed:  93.61s | Words: 4  | Text: 你要告诉我自己
Segment #95  [00:01:55,180 --> 00:01:56,240] | Elapsed:  93.61s | Words: 5  | Text: 我已经失败了
Segment #96  [00:01:56,240 --> 00:01:57,360] | Elapsed:  93.61s | Words: 5  | Text: 我现在就是一条
Segment #97  [00:01:57,360 --> 00:01:58,840] | Elapsed:  93.61s | Words: 6  | Text: 翻不了身的咸鱼
Segment #98  [00:01:58,840 --> 00:02:00,200] | Elapsed:  93.61s | Words: 6  | Text: 然后你要去适应它
Segment #99  [00:02:00,200 --> 00:02:01,060] | Elapsed:  93.61s | Words: 5  | Text: 其实适应的意思
Segment #100 [00:02:01,060 --> 00:02:02,180] | Elapsed:  93.61s | Words: 5  | Text: 更多的是调整
Segment #101 [00:02:02,180 --> 00:02:02,840] | Elapsed:  93.61s | Words: 3  | Text: 就像这个
Segment #102 [00:02:02,840 --> 00:02:03,920] | Elapsed:  93.61s | Words: 6  | Text: 比如说你失恋了
Segment #103 [00:02:03,920 --> 00:02:04,500] | Elapsed:  93.61s | Words: 4  | Text: 你失恋了
Segment #104 [00:02:04,500 --> 00:02:05,320] | Elapsed:  93.61s | Words: 4  | Text: 你要告诉你自己
Segment #105 [00:02:05,320 --> 00:02:05,940] | Elapsed:  93.61s | Words: 4  | Text: 我失恋了
Segment #106 [00:02:05,940 --> 00:02:06,580] | Elapsed:  93.61s | Words: 4  | Text: 你别骗自己
Segment #107 [00:02:06,580 --> 00:02:07,980] | Elapsed:  93.61s | Words: 7  | Text: 你别天天上酒吧
Segment #108 [00:02:07,980 --> 00:02:08,740] | Elapsed:  93.61s | Words: 5  | Text: 找个人零食
Segment #109 [00:02:08,740 --> 00:02:09,800] | Elapsed:  93.61s | Words: 6  | Text: 打火过个日子
Segment #110 [00:02:09,800 --> 00:02:11,180] | Elapsed:  93.61s | Words: 8  | Text: 再找人先凑合凑合
Segment #111 [00:02:11,180 --> 00:02:12,360] | Elapsed:  93.61s | Words: 9  | Text: 上各种的软件上零食
Segment #112 [00:02:12,360 --> 00:02:12,880] | Elapsed:  93.61s | Words: 3  | Text: 去找一个
Segment #113 [00:02:12,880 --> 00:02:14,240] | Elapsed:  93.61s | Words: 7  | Text: 你这样你就又做错了
Segment #114 [00:02:14,240 --> 00:02:15,240] | Elapsed:  93.61s | Words: 4  | Text: 你就先告诉自己
Segment #115 [00:02:15,240 --> 00:02:16,360] | Elapsed:  93.61s | Words: 6  | Text: 你说我现在失败了
Segment #116 [00:02:16,360 --> 00:02:17,160] | Elapsed:  93.61s | Words: 3  | Text: 我就这样了
Segment #117 [00:02:17,160 --> 00:02:17,840] | Elapsed:  93.61s | Words: 4  | Text: 我认命了
Segment #118 [00:02:17,840 --> 00:02:18,720] | Elapsed:  93.61s | Words: 3  | Text: 我知道我自己
Segment #119 [00:02:18,720 --> 00:02:19,640] | Elapsed:  93.61s | Words: 5  | Text: 我就是个傻子
Segment #120 [00:02:19,640 --> 00:02:21,320] | Elapsed:  93.61s | Words: 8  | Text: 我之前我就是得不配位
Segment #121 [00:02:21,320 --> 00:02:22,240] | Elapsed: 113.39s | Words: 3  | Text: 当有一天
Segment #122 [00:02:22,240 --> 00:02:23,380] | Elapsed: 113.39s | Words: 7  | Text: 我的财富和我的能力
Segment #123 [00:02:23,380 --> 00:02:24,160] | Elapsed: 113.39s | Words: 5  | Text: 不成正比的时候
Segment #124 [00:02:24,160 --> 00:02:25,260] | Elapsed: 113.39s | Words: 7  | Text: 这个社会就会通过
Segment #125 [00:02:25,260 --> 00:02:26,740] | Elapsed: 113.39s | Words: 9  | Text: 一百种方法来收割我
Segment #126 [00:02:26,740 --> 00:02:28,080] | Elapsed: 113.39s | Words: 9  | Text: 早晚收割到匹配为止
Segment #127 [00:02:28,080 --> 00:02:28,860] | Elapsed: 113.39s | Words: 3  | Text: 我现在已经
Segment #128 [00:02:28,860 --> 00:02:30,300] | Elapsed: 113.39s | Words: 7  | Text: 我的能力和我的财富
Segment #129 [00:02:30,300 --> 00:02:31,100] | Elapsed: 113.39s | Words: 5  | Text: 已经化等化了
Segment #130 [00:02:31,100 --> 00:02:31,880] | Elapsed: 113.39s | Words: 4  | Text: 我是一个傻子
Segment #131 [00:02:31,880 --> 00:02:32,620] | Elapsed: 113.39s | Words: 4  | Text: 我要重新开始
Segment #132 [00:02:32,620 --> 00:02:33,760] | Elapsed: 113.39s | Words: 5  | Text: 这是第一个阶段
Segment #133 [00:02:33,760 --> 00:02:35,100] | Elapsed: 113.39s | Words: 4  | Text: 然后当你这个
Segment #134 [00:02:35,100 --> 00:02:36,940] | Elapsed: 113.39s | Words: 9  | Text: 慢慢的心态调整完之后
Segment #135 [00:02:36,940 --> 00:02:37,840] | Elapsed: 113.39s | Words: 5  | Text: 准备出发的时候
Segment #136 [00:02:37,840 --> 00:02:38,680] | Elapsed: 113.39s | Words: 4  | Text: 这个时候你要明白
Segment #137 [00:02:38,680 --> 00:02:39,460] | Elapsed: 113.39s | Words: 4  | Text: 钱的重要性
Segment #138 [00:02:39,460 --> 00:02:40,880] | Elapsed: 113.39s | Words: 7  | Text: 什么叫做钱的重要性
Segment #139 [00:02:40,880 --> 00:02:41,820] | Elapsed: 113.39s | Words: 8  | Text: 我不是说我讲这句话
Segment #140 [00:02:41,820 --> 00:02:42,640] | Elapsed: 113.39s | Words: 6  | Text: 直播间的朋友们
Segment #141 [00:02:42,640 --> 00:02:43,460] | Elapsed: 113.39s | Words: 5  | Text: 大家能认同吗
Segment #142 [00:02:43,460 --> 00:02:44,640] | Elapsed: 113.39s | Words: 6  | Text: 就是任何的行业
Segment #143 [00:02:44,640 --> 00:02:45,940] | Elapsed: 113.39s | Words: 5  | Text: 任何的行业
Segment #144 [00:02:45,940 --> 00:02:46,580] | Elapsed: 113.39s | Words: 5  | Text: 任何的生意
Segment #145 [00:02:46,580 --> 00:02:47,400] | Elapsed: 113.39s | Words: 5  | Text: 它都有珠其心
Segment #146 [00:02:47,400 --> 00:02:48,300] | Elapsed: 113.39s | Words: 4  | Text: 所有人的钱
Segment #147 [00:02:48,300 --> 00:02:50,020] | Elapsed: 133.22s | Words: 7  | Text: 都不是一辈子赚的
Segment #148 [00:02:50,020 --> 00:02:51,740] | Elapsed: 133.22s | Words: 8  | Text: 而是在某一个时间阶段
Segment #149 [00:02:51,740 --> 00:02:52,520] | Elapsed: 133.22s | Words: 4  | Text: 有大爆发
Segment #150 [00:02:52,520 --> 00:02:54,600] | Elapsed: 133.22s | Words: 6  | Text: 你比如说你一年
Segment #151 [00:02:54,600 --> 00:02:55,700] | Elapsed: 133.22s | Words: 4  | Text: 行情好的时候
Segment #152 [00:02:55,700 --> 00:02:56,780] | Elapsed: 133.22s | Words: 7  | Text: 我指的是任何行业
Segment #153 [00:02:56,780 --> 00:02:57,840] | Elapsed: 133.22s | Words: 7  | Text: 任何行业都一样
Segment #154 [00:02:57,840 --> 00:02:59,140] | Elapsed: 133.22s | Words: 7  | Text: 你一年做得好的时候
Segment #155 [00:02:59,140 --> 00:03:01,000] | Elapsed: 133.22s | Words: 8  | Text: 能抵得上过往三年
Segment #156 [00:03:01,000 --> 00:03:01,620] | Elapsed: 133.22s | Words: 3  | Text: 五年的钱
Segment #157 [00:03:01,620 --> 00:03:02,940] | Elapsed: 133.22s | Words: 9  | Text: 就是任何的行业都一样
Segment #158 [00:03:02,940 --> 00:03:04,340] | Elapsed: 133.22s | Words: 11 | Text: 你哪怕你开个饭店也一样
Segment #159 [00:03:04,340 --> 00:03:05,480] | Elapsed: 133.22s | Words: 6  | Text: 有可能你这一年
Segment #160 [00:03:05,840 --> 00:03:06,860] | Elapsed: 133.22s | Words: 7  | Text: 对面开了个医院
Segment #161 [00:03:06,860 --> 00:03:07,700] | Elapsed: 133.22s | Words: 4  | Text: 生意就很好
Segment #162 [00:03:07,700 --> 00:03:08,880] | Elapsed: 133.22s | Words: 7  | Text: 第二年的妈医院搬走了
Segment #163 [00:03:08,880 --> 00:03:10,160] | Elapsed: 133.22s | Words: 9  | Text: 你比如说我曾经在澳门
Segment #164 [00:03:10,160 --> 00:03:11,080] | Elapsed: 133.22s | Words: 6  | Text: 坐澳门旅游的时候
Segment #165 [00:03:11,080 --> 00:03:12,220] | Elapsed: 133.22s | Words: 5  | Text: 以前什么都能做
Segment #166 [00:03:12,220 --> 00:03:13,600] | Elapsed: 133.22s | Words: 7  | Text: 法无经济皆可为
Segment #167 [00:03:13,600 --> 00:03:14,360] | Elapsed: 133.23s | Words: 5  | Text: 后来立法了
Segment #168 [00:03:14,360 --> 00:03:15,200] | Elapsed: 133.23s | Words: 4  | Text: 什么都不能做
Segment #169 [00:03:15,200 --> 00:03:16,840] | Elapsed: 133.23s | Words: 6  | Text: 我曾经我在澳门
